| Advanced expanded | boolean | expanded | click `plusMinusAdvancedSearchClaimsClick` | shows/hides `#divAdvancedSearchClaims`; swaps icon class and title “Collapse/Expand” | [js:Scripts/ClaimsManagement/hp.ua3.claimsManagement.searchClaims__884a35a7.js#clickToAdvancedSearchClaimsCollapseExpand, ctl:plusMinusAdvancedSearchClaimsClick] |
| Search By selection | enum (`ICN`/`TCN`/`MCOICN`/none) | none | change `ClaimIdentifiersList` | shows one of: `divClaimIdentifiersList_ICN`, `divClaimIdentifiersList_TCN`, `divClaimIdentifiersList_MCOICN` and toggles the assoc box | [js:Scripts/ClaimsManagement/hp.ua3.claimsManagement.searchClaims__884a35a7.js#claimIdentifiersListChange, kit:k1] |
| Choose Date Type selection | enum | `DOS` | change `DateTypeList` | when non-empty, shows the date range panel (`divDatePanel`) | [js:Scripts/ClaimsManagement/hp.ua3.claimsManagement.searchClaims__884a35a7.js#dateDataTypeListChange, kit:k2] |
