| Provider By selection | enum (`NP`/`PI`/`PN`/`PT`/`PX`) | `NP` (forced when role empty) | change `ProviderByList` | shows one of: NPI, Provider ID (+ maybe Svc Location), Provider Name, Provider Tax ID, Provider Taxonomy | [js:Scripts/ClaimsManagement/hp.ua3.claimsManagement.searchClaims__884a35a7.js#providerByListChange, kit:k7] |
