Additional cross-field / flow validations enforced by the page script:
- IF `FromDate` is greater than `ToDate` THEN THE SYSTEM SHALL show “From Date cannot be greater than To Date.”. [js:Scripts/ClaimsManagement/hp.ua3.claimsManagement.searchClaims__884a35a7.js#checkclaimsValidation, js:js/inline-104.js]
- IF no Search By / Member By / Provider Role criteria are selected AND advanced search is valid THEN THE SYSTEM SHALL show “At least one search criteria value to be entered along with a date range for Date of Service, Date Received, or Date Paid to initiate the search.”. [js:Scripts/ClaimsManagement/hp.ua3.claimsManagement.searchClaims__884a35a7.js#checkclaimsValidation, js:js/inline-104.js, asset:kit/states/search.png]
- IF an identifier/member/provider text field has 1–2 characters THEN THE SYSTEM SHALL show “At least three characters or Numbers are required”. [js:Scripts/ClaimsManagement/hp.ua3.claimsManagement.searchClaims__884a35a7.js#checkclaimsValidation, js:js/inline-104.js]
- IF `ProviderLocationID` has a value AND `ProviderID` is empty THEN THE SYSTEM SHALL show “Provider ID is required when Svc Location ID is entered”. [js:Scripts/ClaimsManagement/hp.ua3.claimsManagement.searchClaims__884a35a7.js#checkclaimsValidation, js:js/inline-104.js]

