## 8. Behavior
### 8.1 Collapse/expand panels
- WHEN the user clicks the Search Criteria collapse control (`plusMinusSearchClaimsClick`) THE SYSTEM SHALL toggle visibility of `#divSearchClaims`. [js:Scripts/ClaimsManagement/hp.ua3.claimsManagement.searchClaims__884a35a7.js#clickToSearchClaimsCollapseExpand, ctl:plusMinusSearchClaimsClick]
- WHEN the user clicks the Advanced collapse control (`plusMinusAdvancedSearchClaimsClick`) THE SYSTEM SHALL toggle visibility of `#divAdvancedSearchClaims` and toggle the icon title between “Collapse” and “Expand”. [js:Scripts/ClaimsManagement/hp.ua3.claimsManagement.searchClaims__884a35a7.js#clickToAdvancedSearchClaimsCollapseExpand, ctl:plusMinusAdvancedSearchClaimsClick]

### 8.2 Selection-driven field visibility
- WHEN `ClaimIdentifiersList` changes THE SYSTEM SHALL clear ICN/TCN/MCO ICN values and show only the associated input for the selected identifier type. [js:Scripts/ClaimsManagement/hp.ua3.claimsManagement.searchClaims__884a35a7.js#claimIdentifiersListChange]
- WHEN `MemberByList` changes THE SYSTEM SHALL clear Member ID/Member Name/Patient Acct values and show only the associated input for the selected member type. [js:Scripts/ClaimsManagement/hp.ua3.claimsManagement.searchClaims__884a35a7.js#claimMemberByListChange]
- WHEN `ProviderRoleList` changes from empty to non-empty THE SYSTEM SHALL show the Provider By selector region; WHEN it becomes empty THE SYSTEM SHALL hide the Provider By selector region and set Provider By to `NP`. [js:Scripts/ClaimsManagement/hp.ua3.claimsManagement.searchClaims__884a35a7.js#providerRoleListChange]
- WHEN `ProviderByList` changes THE SYSTEM SHALL clear provider inputs and show the associated provider input panel for the selected type. [js:Scripts/ClaimsManagement/hp.ua3.claimsManagement.searchClaims__884a35a7.js#providerByListChange]
- WHEN `DiagnosisTypeList` is set to `01` THE SYSTEM SHALL show the ICD-9 code input and hide ICD-10; WHEN set to `02` it SHALL show ICD-10 and hide ICD-9. [js:Scripts/ClaimsManagement/hp.ua3.claimsManagement.searchClaims__884a35a7.js#icdDataTypeListChange]

### 8.3 Actions
- WHEN the user clicks Reset (`resetButton`) THE SYSTEM SHALL clear criteria, set Date Type to `DOS`, set DX Type to `02`, and reset Total Billed Range From/To display to “$0.00”. [js:Scripts/ClaimsManagement/hp.ua3.claimsManagement.searchClaims__884a35a7.js#editorResetPreprocess, js:Scripts/ClaimsManagement/hp.ua3.claimsManagement.searchClaims__884a35a7.js#editorResetPostprocess]
- WHEN the user clicks Search (`nextButton`) AND validations pass THE SYSTEM SHALL send a POST to `/api/ClaimsManagement/SearchClaims/` with `application/x-www-form-urlencoded` body from `$(formId).serialize()`. [js:Scripts/ClaimsManagement/hp.ua3.claimsManagement.searchClaims__884a35a7.js#processNext, js:js/inline-104.js]
- WHEN the user clicks Cancel (`cancelButton`) THE SYSTEM SHALL navigate to `/Home/MyHome/` in the same tab. [ctl:cancelButton, ctl:Editor_CancelActionUrl]

