## 1. Overview
Search Claims lets a portal user search for claims using claim identifiers, date type + date range, member/provider selectors, and advanced criteria (claim type/status, modifiers, totals, diagnosis). [asset:sections/01-search-claims.png]

Primary tasks:
- Enter search criteria and run Search. [ctl:nextButton, asset:sections/01-search-claims.png]
- Reset all criteria to defaults. [ctl:resetButton, asset:sections/01-search-claims.png]
- Cancel and return to the portal home page. [ctl:cancelButton, ctl:Editor_CancelActionUrl]

